BLACKPINK, BLINKs, forever.

573
01:33:31.188 --> 01:33:33.107
-JENNIE: Aww.
-(all laugh)

574
01:33:33.190 --> 01:33:34.900
-(in Korean) Thank you for reacting.
-Hey, wait.

575
01:33:34.984 --> 01:33:36.777
-Nice.
-What is this? I think it's great.

576
01:33:37.194 --> 01:33:38.446
Can you just finish like this?

577
01:33:38.529 --> 01:33:40.781
(in English)
BLACKPINK, BLINKs, forever.

578
01:33:42.116 --> 01:33:44.660
Thank you.
Shall we try it together? Shall we?

579
01:33:44.744 --> 01:33:46.871
Like this, BLACKPINK, BLINKs. forever.

580
01:33:46.954 --> 01:33:48.748
Okay, five, six, seven, eight.

581
01:33:48.831 --> 01:33:51.751
BLACKPINK, BLINKs, forever.

582
01:33:51.834 --> 01:33:53.836
Oh, thank you, guys!

583
01:33:55.212 --> 01:33:56.422
ROSÉ (in Korean): So funny.

584
01:33:56.505 --> 01:33:58.716
(light music)

585
01:34:07.516 --> 01:34:09.727
(upbeat music)

586
01:36:24.445 --> 01:36:26.155
JENNIE (in English): <i>And I miss you guys.</i>
